{color.GG}Remake {color.N}recreates files or directories by removing the existing target and creating a fresh replacement.

Usage: {color.GG}remake {color.CC}<file|dir> [--mode <xxxx>]{color.N}

Example:
    {color.R}- {color.GG}remake {color.CC}build/{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}remake {color.CC}cache/ --mode 0755{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}remake {color.CC}output.log{color.N}